### SmartAdmin 示例宿主 —— 机构 / 职位
# 机构树是数据范围的锚:实体上的 CreateOrgId 决定了它落在谁的范围里。
# 后端只返回平铺列表,树由前端按 parentId 自己拼。

@host = http://localhost:5100
@account = superAdmin
@password = <粘贴首启控制台打印的随机密码>

### 登录 —— 先跑这条
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 全部机构(平铺,按 sort、id 排序)—— 种子播了 7 个,1 是根
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/list
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 新增机构 —— parentId 0 表示顶级;code 留空则后端自动生成
# category 取 org_category 字典的 value:1 公司 / 2 部门 / 3 小组
# @name addOrg
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/add
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 3,
  "name": "示例小组",
  "code": "demo_team",
  "category": "3",
  "sort": 9,
  "enabled": true
}

### 机构详情
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/{{addOrg.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 更新机构
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/{{addOrg.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 3,
  "name": "示例小组(已改名)",
  "code": "demo_team",
  "category": "3",
  "sort": 8,
  "enabled": true
}

### 复制机构子树 —— 整支克隆挂到源节点同级,返回新根 Id;name 留空则给原名加「-副本」
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/{{addOrg.response.body.$.data.id}}/copy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例小组-克隆"
}

### 删除机构 —— 底下还挂着子机构会被拒
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sys/org/{{addOrg.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 分页查询职位
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sys/position/page?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 新增职位
# @name addPosition
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sys/position/add
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例职位",
  "code": "demo_position",
  "sort": 9,
  "enabled": true
}

### 更新职位
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sys/position/{{addPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例职位(已改名)",
  "code": "demo_position",
  "sort": 8,
  "enabled": false
}

### 删除职位
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sys/position/{{addPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
